            "speaker_id": 107378,
            "reply_to": "M9",
            "text": "Great, that's settled then. Now for ownership. Based on the steps, here's what I propose: Steps 1 & part of 7 -> Office Clerks. Steps 2, 3, 4, 6 & part of 7 -> Payroll Clerks. Step 5 -> Finance Manager (external). Does everyone agree with these role assignments?",
